</path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif-deck text-text-default mb-4 text-[24px] leading-[1.3] xl:mb-5 xl:text-[28px]\">Slow A/B creative tests</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary font-sans text-[15px] leading-normal xl:text-[17px]\">Every hook, offer, background or badge change becomes another design ticket.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start text-left\"><div class=\"bg-bg-overlay-l2 rounded-lo-radius-12 mb-5 flex h-[60px] w-[60px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center md:mb-6\"><span class=\"text-icon-default flex size-6 items-center justify-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" d=\"M10.05 2c.728 0 1.409.208 1.984.567a3.74 3.74 0 0 1 2 .5l3.032 1.75c.63.364 1.115.885 1.434 1.484a3.74 3.74 0 0 1 1.483 1.433l1.75 3.032a3.75 3.75 0 0 1-1.372 5.122l-9.288 5.362A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 2.8 16.5V5.75A3.75 3.75 0 0 1 6.55 2zM9.3 16.5a1 1 0 1 0-2 0 1 1 0 0 0 2 0m9.566-7.698c-.078.39-.217.775-.427 1.138l-4.613 7.987 5.785-3.338a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 .823-3.073zM10.8 16.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1-5 0 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0m-6.5 0a4 4 0 0 0 8 0V5.75a2.245 2.245 0 0 0-2.25-2.25h-3.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 4.3 5.75zm9.5-1.525 3.34-5.785a2.246 2.246 0 0 0-.824-3.074L13.602 4.55c.127.377.198.78.198 1.201z\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"font-serif-deck text-text-default mb-4 text-[24px] leading-[1.3] xl:mb-5 xl:text-[28px]\">Brand drift across channels</h3><p class=\"text-text-secondary font-sans text-[15px] leading-normal xl:text-[17px]\">PDP assets, ad creatives, emails and social posts slowly stop looking like the same brand.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start text-left\"><div class=\"bg-bg-overlay-l2 rounded-lo-radius-12 mb-5 flex h-[60px] w-[60px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center md:mb-6\"><span class=\"text-icon-default flex size-6 items-center justify-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"